From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 15:34:18 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] test(v2): supply standard translation hook for full ABC
 linkage

Maintenance explanation added during mailbox export:
Supply the standard translation hook required when the native Avalanche test links the full ABC libraries. The latest reported integrated build and transaction and Avalanche runtime unit gates pass at this revision; this does not establish network Avalanche interoperability.

---
 src/lotus_v2/test_avalanche_v2.cpp | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/lotus_v2/test_avalanche_v2.cpp b/src/lotus_v2/test_avalanche_v2.cpp
index 2d8775e23e1036c06d680354c3143c33a0aa72cd..b79260ff4425d5d37683c90b7cc2b0993a1825a0 100644
--- a/src/lotus_v2/test_avalanche_v2.cpp
+++ b/src/lotus_v2/test_avalanche_v2.cpp
@@ -4,10 +4,12 @@
 #include <avalanche/proofbuilder.h>
 #include <avalanche/delegationbuilder.h>
 #include <key.h>
+#include <util/translation.h>
 #include <iostream>
 #include <stdexcept>
 using namespace lotus::v2;
 using namespace lotus::v2::ava;
+const std::function<std::string(const char *)> G_TRANSLATION_FUN = nullptr;
 #define CHECK(x) do { if (!(x)) throw std::runtime_error(#x); } while (0)
 int main() {
  ECC_Start();
